#: .\templates\about\about.html:13
msgid "About Speedy Match"
msgstr "Speedy Match-i buruz"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:17 .\templates\main\main_page.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Match\">Speedy Match</a> is a new dating/matching web app for romantic "
"purposes for singles who are members of <a href=\"https://%(language_code)s."
"speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy Net\">Speedy Net</a>. With Speedy Match you can "
"find matching people for dating and chat with them online. You can add "
"people as friends on Speedy Net, like people and send them messages. Speedy "
"Match is open to free registration for people from all countries and ages "
"(no age limit!). The site is vegan and vegetarian friendly. It is currently "
"available in %(languages_num)s languages."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Match\">Speedy Match</a> sareko zita eta bateragarritasun web-aplikazio "
"berria da, <a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Net\">Speedy Net</a>-eko kide diren ezkongabeentzat eta helburu "
"erromantikoetarako. Speedy Match-ekin zitetarako pertsona bateragarriak "
"aurki ditzakezu eta haiekin sarean txateatu. Speedy Net-en pertsonak lagun "
"gisa gehi ditzakezu, atsegin eman eta mezuak bidali. Speedy Match doako "
"erregistroa egiteko irekita dago herrialde eta adin guztietako jendearentzat "
"(adin-mugarik gabe!). Webgunea begano eta begetarianoentzat egokia da. Gaur "
"egun %(languages_num)s hizkuntzatan dago erabilgarri."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:19
msgid ""
"The founders of Speedy Match are vegan, support animal rights and object to "
"experiments on animals. Speedy Match is a dating app friendly for vegan and "
"vegetarian people and animals."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Match-en sortzaileak beganoak dira, animalien eskubideak babesten "
"dituzte eta animaliekin egindako esperimentuen aurka daude. Speedy Match "
"begano eta begetariano diren pertsonentzat eta animalientzat lagunkoi den "
"zita-aplikazioa da."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:21
msgid ""
"Only people who match your requirements will be able to see your profile and "
"contact you. We don't allow anonymous searches and Speedy Match profiles are "
"visible to matching partners only. You can select who will be able to see "
"your profile and which details will appear on your profile as public, which "
"details only to friends and which details will be private. Private details "
"will appear only to you."
msgstr ""
"Zure baldintzekin bat datozen pertsonek bakarrik ikusi ahal izango dute zure "
"profila eta zurekin harremanetan jarri. Ez dugu bilaketa anonimorik "
"onartzen, eta Speedy Match profilak bateragarriak diren bikotekideentzat "
"bakarrik dira ikusgai. Aukera dezakezu nork ikusi ahal izango duen zure "
"profila eta zer datu agertuko diren publiko gisa, zein lagunentzat bakarrik "
"eta zein pribatuak izango diren. Datu pribatuak zuk bakarrik ikusiko dituzu."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:23
msgid ""
"All the features on Speedy Net and Speedy Match are free of charge. Join "
"Speedy Match today to find matching partners, it only takes a few minutes. "
"<a href=\"/\" title=\"Join Speedy Match\">Click here</a> to join."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net eta Speedy Match-eko eginbide guztiak doakoak dira. Egin bat "
"Speedy Match-ekin gaur bertan bateragarriak diren bikotekideak aurkitzeko; "
"minutu batzuk baino ez dira behar. <a href=\"/\" title=\"Join Speedy "
"Match\">Egin klik hemen</a> izena emateko."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:25
msgid ""
"Speedy Match is a free software & open source project. If you want to help "
"developing and improving Speedy Match, please contact me by email."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Match software libreko eta kode irekiko proiektua da. Speedy Match "
"garatzen eta hobetzen lagundu nahi baduzu, jarri nirekin harremanetan posta "
"elektronikoz."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:27
msgid ""
"Speedy Match is named after <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the."
"female.dog\" title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, a female dog that was with us for "
"many years and died in 2003. Speedy gave birth to 7 puppies in 1988."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Match <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a> izeneko txakur emearen omenez izendatu zen; urte "
"askotan gurekin egon zen eta 2003an hil zen. Speedyk 7 txakurkume izan "
"zituen 1988an."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:29
msgid ""
"Speedy Match is currently in alpha. It was launched in August 2019. The "
"English version of Speedy Match is in production."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Match alpha fasean dago gaur egun. 2019ko abuztuan jarri zen abian. "
"Speedy Match-en ingelesezko bertsioa ekoizpenean dago."

